# {{name}}

Turborepo. The site lives in `apps/web` (see that app's `AGENTS.md` for code
standards and the Next.js docs pointer).

## Commands

Run from this directory; they go through Turborepo:

```bash
npm run dev           # start the site
npm run build         # build every workspace
npm run check         # lint + format:check + check-types
npm run fix           # lint:fix + format
npm test              # tests (TURBO_FORCE=true for an uncached run)
```

`npm run lint` must run inside `apps/web` (turbo does that) so Oxlint loads
`oxlint.config.ts` and the shadcn preset. Running oxlint from the root lints
with defaults.

## Rules

- No em dashes in copy, content, docs, or commit messages.
- `next.config.ts` keeps `cacheComponents`, `partialPrefetching`, and
  `reactCompiler` on. Read the Instant Navigations rules in
  `apps/web/AGENTS.md` before adding a route.
- Call sites may add layout classes (`mt-4`, `w-full`); restyle in
  `components/ui/` instead.
